  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to Africa-Led Movement to End Female Genital Mutilation (FGM) Ph2: Data and Measurement is a component of Supporting the Africa-led Movement to End Female Genital Mutilation (FGM): Phase II  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;801,590. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Human rights, Health education, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Reproductive health care, Ending violence against women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
